th either intelligent computer-controlled characters or  friends</strong> (couch co-op) for even more chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plenty of character customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your character's abilities</strong> to bring into battle, customizing them with augments: discoverable gems that adjust the characteristics of skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn passive abilities</strong> from the equipment your characters use. These abilities may give buffs at the start of combat, give you a boost of strength while your allies are down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine skills</strong> to build your own devastating combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.poster.avif?t=1759163937\" aria-label=\"Clip of a character traveling to a mansion in the snow\" width=400 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.webm?t=1759163937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.mp4?t=1759163937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A focus on fun</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a 15-25 hour main story</strong> that focuses on interpersonal relationships and the world they've been born into.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy gameplay variety</strong>: minigames, puzzles, quests to complete. Your decisions and performance affect the game's difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encouraged item usage</strong> over hoarding. P