b69fceeae74550345f.600x338.jpg?t=1759163937"}],"short_description":"Starless Umbra is a story-rich action RPG inspired by classic and modern JRPGs. Engage in real-time combat, customize your party, and explore puzzle-filled dungeons in a couch co-op adventure where friendship and loyalty are tested in a world consumed by a noxious fog.","steam_appid":3101780,"support_info":{"email":"support@alcuria.net","url":"https://starlessumbra.com/ask"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"https://starlessumbra.com"}